{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25138","headline":"月夜 · 卢殷","name":"月夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露下凉生簟，无人月满庭。\n难闻逆河浪，徒望白榆星。\n树遶孤栖鹊，窗飞就暗萤。\n移时宿兰影，思共习芳馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢殷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}